      "title": "Algorithmic rent setting ban",
      "requirement": "Landlords are prohibited from employing, using, or relying on an algorithmic device or coordinator when setting, renewing, or changing rent amounts, or when determining occupancy levels.",
      "requirement_es": "Se prohíbe a los arrendadores emplear, utilizar o basarse en un dispositivo algorítmico o coordinador al establecer, renovar o cambiar los montos de alquiler, o al determinar niveles de ocupación.",
      "key_value": {
        "label": "algorithmic pricing",
        "value": "prohibited"
      },
      "coverage_conditions": {
        "type": "ALWAYS",
        "clauses": []
      },
